{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"93955","name":"Piraeus Theoxenia","description":"This charming hotel sits right in the centre of Piraeus, with its beautiful port, promenade and the University just a 5-minute walk away. It is perfectly connected with the rest of the city and the Airport thanks to the bus and metro station that sits just 200 metres from it. The hotel itself is one of the new landmark buildings that inhabit the prestigious block of the business district of Greece's biggest port. Its unique architecture combines elements of the neoclassical style with modern building design in order to create a delightful mix of classical worldly charm and comfortable modernity. It is a great place for all executive travellers due to its excellent conference and business facilities. After a day of meetings they can head to the relaxed onsite bar for a pleasant chat and a chilled drink.","address":"Karaoli Ke Dimitriou, 23","city":"PIREAUS","countryCode":"GR","postalCode":"18531","lat":37.945433,"lng":23.647179,"stars":5,"giataCode":"88600","phone":"00302104112550","email":"piraeus@thetheoxeniapalace.com","website":"www.thetheoxeniapalace.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/093955/093955a_hb_a_004.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/093955/093955a_hb_l_003.jpg","category":"lobby","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/093955/093955a_hb_l_007.jpg","category":"lobby","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/093955/093955a_hb_l_005.jpg","category":"lobby","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/093955/093955a_hb_l_004.jpg","category":"lobby","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/093955/093955a_hb_l_006.jpg","category":"lobby","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/093955/093955a_hb_w_005.jpg","category":"room","order":6},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com